 "name_en": "Lockbox (1JT)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Lockbox (1JT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa6bded162d2748e08fa0a616f97d4340\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa6bded162d2748e08fa0a616f97d4340__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With lockbox processes, customer can simply collect and process incoming payments if the lockbox service is offered by banks in the United States of America.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa6bded162d2748e08fa0a616f97d4340__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Upload lockbox files</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reprocess incoming checks</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage lockbox batches</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Schedule Accounts Receivable jobs – Automatic Lockbox Processing (Optional and license for SAP Cash Application required)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa6bded162d2748e08fa0a616f97d4340__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Simplify the process of incoming payments</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage lockbox files and batches easily</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>保险箱 (1JT)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioa6bded162d2748e08fa0a616f97d4340\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa6bded162d2748e08fa0a616f97d4340__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过支票箱流程，如果支票箱服务由美国银行提供，则客户可以简单地收集和处理收款。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa6bded162d2748e08fa0a616f97d4340__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">上传支票箱文件</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">重新处理收款支票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理支票箱批次</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计划应收账款作业 – 自动支票箱处理（可选且需要 SAP Cash Application 许可证）</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioa6bded162d2748e08fa0a616f97d4340__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">简化收款流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松管理支票箱文件和批次</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
